Tiny BIDS fixture for BIDSvue's E2E suite.

Used by tests/e2e/specs/{happy-path,viewer}.e2e.ts via the
BIDSVUE_TEST_OPEN_DATASET env var bypass (see
src-tauri/src/lib.rs::test_open_dataset).

The sub-*/anat/*_T1w.nii.gz files are real, minimal NIfTI-1 volumes
(16x16x16 uint8, radial gradient, ~731 bytes gzipped). They used to be
zero-byte placeholders, but viewer.e2e.ts runs under
BIDSVUE_E2E_REQUIRE_VIEWER_RENDER=1 in CI, which requires NiiVue to load
the volume and render nonblank WebGL2 pixels — an empty file fails that
gate with "Out of bounds access". The gradient guarantees a wide spread
of luminance values so the render probe sees a nonblank canvas even under
software Mesa/llvmpipe. Regenerate with the header layout documented in
src/lib/deface/headerProbe.ts (sizeof_hdr=348, dim, datatype=2/UINT8,
vox_offset=352, magic "n+1", sform identity affine).
